{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrickLayer draws from the classic and timeless formular of block building, with no rules, BrickLayer gives the player complete freedom to build whatever they feel like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/a2e74447faf110425879e4fbd665e267.poster.avif?t=1764891005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/a2e74447faf110425879e4fbd665e267.webm?t=1764891005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/a2e74447faf110425879e4fbd665e267.mp4?t=1764891005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Product Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brick Building Tools:</strong>\u00a0Allows players to scroll through different brick types, change colours, rotate, place, and delete bricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Base Plate Generation:</strong>\u00a0This feature allows players to never run out of space for builds. For performance purposes, players can adjust the render distance in the settings menu.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Graphics Settings:</strong> To allow players with lower end computers to play with good performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Music:</strong>\u00a0Ambient music will play at random times. The music volume can be adjusted in the settings menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple World Slots:</strong>\u00a0Players aren't limited to one world slot for their builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ways of Movement:</strong> Players can walk and fly, this allows players to build with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather:</strong>\u00a0The worlds use dynamic weather to help them feel alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and Night Cycle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.poster.avif?t=1764891005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.webm?t=1764891005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/2ef3c6ec608c8da868246bda6f558972.mp4?t=1764891005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/0e29f4c39d4c4364a596b8d4f24ee060.poster.avif?t=1764891005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/0e29f4c39d4c4364a596b8d4f24ee060.webm?t=1764891005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/extras/0e29f4c39d4c4364a596b8d4f24ee060.mp4?t=1764891005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909510?t=1764891005","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909510?t=1764891005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909510/36ce3d83e7602307e44e690478d980630fc4be8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764891005","capsule_imagev5":"ht